  "description": "AI integration for Bowire — registers a Microsoft.Extensions.AI IChatClient and exposes the workbench's chat / probe endpoints. Default connector is Ollama via OllamaSharp (auto-detect on 127.0.0.1:11434 + LM Studio on :1234); embedded hosts override with their own IChatClient registration so Bowire reuses whatever AI infrastructure the host already runs. Ships as a standalone NuGet so installs that don't want AI don't pull Microsoft.Extensions.AI's transitive weight. Same opt-in shape as the protocol plugins.",
